```

## B.8 POLR repair example

```text
Objective:
    Repair borrowed-value lifetime escape

Cause:
    Return reference points into local storage

Candidate A:
    Return owned storage

Candidate B:
    Borrow from caller-owned input

Candidate C:
    Introduce validated owned handle

Evaluation:
    Interface compatibility
    Ownership legality
    Allocation impact
    Change scope
    Verification burden

Result:
    Best feasible route under selected POLR profile
```

